      "id": "principal-names",
      "claim": "IAM migration 23 adds principals.display_name_locked. An SSO sign-in to the console or the portal refreshes the principal's email, and its name from the identity's name, username or email unless an administrator named it; a failed refresh leaves the principal as it was. POST /admin/api/principals/{id}/rename names a principal, locks the name against sign-in refreshes and records principal.rename; principals report name_set_by_admin.",
      "status": "observed",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "go/internal/iam/schema.go; go/internal/iam/repository.go; go/internal/iam/models.go; go/internal/api/sso.go; go/internal/api/iam.go; go/internal/api/server.go; go/internal/api/principal_names_test.go; go/internal/iam/principal_names_test.go; docs/MULTI_USER.md"
      }
    },
